    "body": "Fix a bug where PHP traits with multiple functions only detected the first function, which incorrectly spanned the entire file. The issue was in _function_body() - the condition to detect function end used self.in_class but didn't account for self.in_trait. Functions inside traits now correctly end at brace level 1, same as classes. Fixes the issue reported for lizard 1.18.\r\nResolves: [#441 ](https://github.com/terryyin/lizard/issues/441)",
